              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Analyze the output from {{$context.$nodes.UPDATE_DEVELOPING_SKILLS.$output}}\n\nIf the skills were updated successfully, display \"Profile updated for skills - {{$context.$nodes.GET_SKILLS_LIST.$output.result}}\". \nElse display \"Profile update failed for skills - {{$context.$nodes.GET_SKILLS_LIST.$output.result}}\".\nDo not add any explanations.\n\n##Text Formatting Guidelines:\n\n- Display data from arrays as comma separated plaintext do not surround them with braces.\n-Use title case for all skill names"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
